around its trigger, even though it renders in a portal, and `size` overrides that."},"951":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-18","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#default","content":"Compose a Modal from a `Heading slot=\"title\"`, a `CloseButton`, `Content`, and a\n`ButtonGroup`. `ModalTrigger` opens the Modal and manages its open/close state."},"952":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-19","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#controlled","content":"Pass `isOpen` and `onOpenChange` to `ModalTrigger` to control the open state externally."},"953":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-20","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#scrollable","content":"When the content is taller than the viewport, the `Content` region scrolls while the title\nrow and the `ButtonGroup` stay pinned."},"954":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-21","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#triggerless","content":"`Modal` accepts `isOpen` and `onOpenChange` directly, so it can be controlled without a\n`ModalTrigger`. Useful when the modal is opened from several places at once."},"955":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-22","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#size","content":"`size` sets the modal's text, controls, and spacing. Without it, the modal follows the size\nscope around its trigger."},"956":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-23","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#with-text-lockup","content":"A `TextLockup` in the content keeps its own title. The modal's `Heading slot=\"title\"` still names\nthe dialog."},"957":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-24","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"Key"},"958":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-25","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"Action"},"959":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-26","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"`Tab`"},"960":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-27","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"Moves focus to the next focusable element inside the modal"},"961":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-28","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"`Escape`"},"962":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-29","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"Closes the modal (unless `isKeyboardDismissDisabled`)"},"963":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-30","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#aria","content":"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"},"964":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-31","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#aria","content":"Focus is trapped within the modal while open and returned to the trigger on close"},"965":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-32","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#best-practices","content":"Always include a `Heading slot=\"title\"` so the dialog has an accessible name; otherwise pass `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` on `<Modal>`"},"966":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-33","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#best-practices","content":"Pair every action button with `slot=\"close\"` when it should dismiss the modal"},"967":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-34","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#best-practices","content":"Set `isDismissable={false}` to prevent outside-click dismissal for required confirmations; to also block `Escape`, pass `isKeyboardDismissDisabled`"},"968":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"page","content":"NumberField","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field"},"969":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-0","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field","content":"NumberField is a composed numeric input with min/max/step and optional increment/decrement stepper buttons. Use it in forms for quantities, amounts, or percentages."},"970":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-1","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"Features"},"971":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-2","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#installation","content":"Installation"},"972":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-3","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#examples","content":"Examples"},"973":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-4","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#default","content":"Default"},"974":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-5","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"975":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-6","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#invalid","content":"Invalid"},"976":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-7","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#disabled","content":"Disabled"},"977":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-8","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#hide-stepper","content":"Hide Stepper"},"978":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-9","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#value-scale","content":"Value Scale"},"979":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-10","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#format-options-numbering-system","content":"Format options (numbering system)"},"980":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-11","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"981":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-12","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#text-steppers","content":"Text Steppers"},"982":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-13","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#props","content":"Props"},"983":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-14","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/number-field#numberfield","content":"NumberField"},"984":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-15","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"},"985":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-16","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"},"986":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-17","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"},"987":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-18","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"},"988":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-19","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"989":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-20","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"990":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-21","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#default","content":"Minimal usage with a `Label`, min/max, and stepper `Button`s."},"991":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-22","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#controlled","content":"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."},"992":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-23","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#invalid","content":"Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` for validation feedback."},"993":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-24","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#disabled","content":"Use `isDisabled` to prevent input."},"994":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-25","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#hide-stepper","content":"Compose without stepper `Button`s for a plain numeric input."},"995":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-26","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#value-scale","content":"Use `minValue`, `maxValue`, and `step` to set the allowed values. Steps are calculated from the minimum value."},"996":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-27","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#format-options-numbering-system","content":"By default, NumberField displays the value using the numbering system for the user's locale. Use the `formatOptions` prop to override the numbering system by setting the Unicode numbering system locale extension."},"997":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-28","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#sizes","content":"`size` sets the label, input, and steppers. Without it, the field follows the surrounding size\nscope."},"998":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-29","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#text-steppers","content":"Compose with `children` to replace the stepper icons with your own content, such as text."},"999":{"id":"/docs/components/popover","page_id":"/docs/components/popover","type":"page","content":"Popover","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/popover"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/comp